30:["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"od-rp-points","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"od-rp-points","className":"m-0 mb-[var(--space-3)]","children":"Main points"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"m-0 flex max-w-[var(--measure-en)] list-disc flex-col gap-[var(--space-2)] pl-[var(--space-6)]","children":[["$","li","The Student Council appointed an 11-member ad hoc committee on 6 February 2026 and a 7-member sub-committee on 12 March 2026.",{"children":"The Student Council appointed an 11-member ad hoc committee on 6 February 2026 and a 7-member sub-committee on 12 March 2026."}],["$","li","The report finds five linked problems: the building and its ventilation, hygiene, too little equipment, food prices that do not match portions, and pigeons.",{"children":"The report finds five linked problems: the building and its ventilation, hygiene, too little equipment, food prices that do not match portions, and pigeons."}],["$","li","It makes 14 recommendations: an urgent and a long-term measure for each of six topics (12), a pigeon plan, and one future step.",{"children":"It makes 14 recommendations: an urgent and a long-term measure for each of six topics (12), a pigeon plan, and one future step."}],["$","li","In the questionnaire, seating (150 mentions) and pigeons (120) were the two problems named most often.",{"children":"In the questionnaire, seating (150 mentions) and pigeons (120) were the two problems named most often."}],["$","li","The pigeon plan would take 1 month and about 60,000 baht: plastic curtains at 25,000 baht and a reflective ceiling at 35,000 baht. The sound and UV-cloth approaches show no cost.",{"children":"The pigeon plan would take 1 month and about 60,000 baht: plastic curtains at 25,000 baht and a reflective ceiling at 35,000 baht. The sound and UV-cloth approaches show no cost."}],["$","li","The report has no date, and no response to any recommendation is recorded.",{"children":"The report has no date, and no response to any recommendation is recorded."}]]}]]}]
